2. snes9x libretro core — NOT in this repository
   snes9x is fetched from https://github.com/libretro/snes9x at the revision in
   ThirdParty/libretro/CORE_REVISION and compiled during the build by
   scripts/build-core.sh. It is deliberately not vendored, so that this
   repository contains no copy of it.

   snes9x is distributed under its own license, which permits
   non-commercial use only. A binary built from this repository
   statically links snes9x and is therefore subject to that license, not to
   the MIT license above — including its non-commercial restriction. See the
   upstream repository for the exact terms.

